{"ticker":"AONESTEELS","symbol":"AONESTEELS","instrumentId":3204548,"name":"A-One Steels India Ltd","industry":"NSE-Steel-Producers","about":"A-one Steels India is a backward integrated steel manufacturer producing long, flat, and industrial steel products. Its portfolio includes sponge iron, MS billets, TMT bars, HR and CR coils, pipes, galvanized tubes, met coke, silicon manganese, and ferrosilicon. The company operates six manufacturing facilities across Karnataka and Andhra Pradesh, supported by solar and wind power arrangements. Its products are used in construction, infrastructure, automotive, power plants, dams, airports, bridges, highways, marine structures, industrial buildings, and residential projects. A-one Steels integrates raw material production with downstream steel processing, enabling it to manufacture products across multiple stages of the steel value chain.","website":"www.aonesteelgroup.com","location":null,"exchange":"NSE","fetchedAt":"2026-11-20T12:59:07.663Z","basis":"consolidated","price":{"value":468.95,"changePct":-0.11714589989350614,"week52High":478.6,"week52Low":0},"stats":[{"label":"Market capitalization","value":"₹3,622 Cr"},{"label":"Sales","value":"₹3,295 Cr"},{"label":"Shares in float","value":"19,308,000"},{"label":"No. of funds","value":"32"},{"label":"Shares held by funds","value":"5,076,255"},{"label":"Dividend yield","value":"0.00%"},{"label":"Book value","value":"0.18"},{"label":"U/D vol ratio","value":"0.8"},{"label":"LTDebt / equity","value":"39.0%"},{"label":"Alpha","value":"0.46"},{"label":"Beta","value":"-0.06"},{"label":"EPS growth rate","value":"136%"},{"label":"P/E ratio","value":"17.5"},{"label":"5-year P/E range","value":"—"},{"label":"Return on equity","value":"8.7%"},{"label":"Cash flow (INR)","value":"9.17"},{"label":"Volume","value":"513,146"},{"label":"Avg volume (50d)","value":"879,741"},{"label":"Master score","value":"74"},{"label":"EPS rating","value":"68"},{"label":"Price strength","value":"81"},{"label":"